## Quick Reference

```bash
# Generate workload config from TOML
repm gen-config

# Run experiment (all schedulers, default reps)
repm run --reps {{defaults.reps}}

# Dry-run to see planned matrix
repm run --dry-run

# Run single scheduler smoke test
repm run --schedulers eevdf --reps 1

# Analyze results
repm analyze --experiment experiments/v001_initial/

# Capture production trace
repm capture --duration 300
```
